From b1fe959d67f2be0a34d919132a9c065c1350a7fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zglstudylinux <zglstudylinux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:33:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] t113: zgl_board add ST7701SN MIPI panel (D240N2501V1 480x640)
 and display fixes

- new st7701sn_d240n2501v1 panel driver: 44-init-cmd DSI 2-lane video
  mode, PD20 active-low reset, PWM7 backlight, /tmp/st7701sn_init marker
- fl7707n_mipi kept for registration self-consistency (config off)
- panels.c/.h/Kconfig/Makefile: register both panels
- disp_display.c: late_initcall re-disable+enable after 3s, fixes DSI
  half-initialized state at every boot (fps < ref_fps)
- dev_fb.c: force fb layer fullscreen geometry and fb addr, fixes
  half-screen from stale boot_disp injection
- disp_lcd.c: one [LCD-DBG] debug print

Verified on board: logo at boot, /tmp/st7701sn_init = 'OK 44 cmds 5
delays', fps 65.3 vs ref 65, frame[0,0,480,640], colorbar/snow/black
tests pass (adb, 2026-10-15).
